to detect via magic. Nondetection attempts to counteract all detection, revelation, and scrying divinations made against the target or the target's gear throughout the duration, counting cantrips as 1st-level spells for this purpose. Successfully counteracting a divination that targets an area or multiple targets negates the effects only for nondetection's target.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"nondetection","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature or object"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"8 hours","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"O4rVEY06ufxUDH95","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":true},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688941968408,"modifiedTime":1688941968408,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.EoKBlgf6Smt8opaU","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"QfAp6mB8NZsBTbEd"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/darkness.webp","name":"Darkness","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create a shroud of darkness that prevents light from penetrating or emanating within the area. Light does not enter the area and any non-magical light sources, such as a torch or lantern, do not emanate any light while inside the area, even if their light radius would extend beyond the darkness. This also suppresses magical light of your darkness spell's level or lower. Light can't pass through, so creatures in the area can't see outside. From outside, it appears as a globe of pure darkness.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> Even creatures with darkvision (but not greater darkvision) can barely see through the darkness. They treat targets seen through the darkness as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkness","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","darkness","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":20},"time":{"value":"3"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"O4rVEY06ufxUDH95","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688941972913,"modifiedTime":1688941988197,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.4GE2ZdODgIQtg51c","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"5AZWiifLj1zn0zkM"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/freedom-of-movement.webp","name":"Freedom of Movement (Constant)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You repel effects that would hinder a creature or slow its movement. While under this spell's effect, the target ignores effects that would give them a circumstance penalty to Speed. When they attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} an effect that has them @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}, they automatically succeed unless the effect is magical and of a higher level than the freedom of movement spell.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"freedom-of-movement","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature touched"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"O4rVEY06ufxUDH95","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{}}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688941978739,"modifiedTime":1688942010393,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aqRYNoSvxsVfqglH","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"MCLIZH3TkDlZ78vD"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dimension-door.webp","name":"Dimension Door","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Opening a door that bypasses normal space, you instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to a clear space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you-even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container-the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dimension-door","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","teleportation"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"O4rVEY06ufxUDH95","heightenedLevel":5},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"5":{"range":{"value":"1 mile"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688941994451,"modifiedTime":1688941996507,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.VlNcjmYyu95vOUe8","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"HvByNc4G0yJgJCfx"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Constant Spells","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ConstantSpells]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"constant-spells","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"val